Bundled Binaries (Windows installer)
------------------------------------
The Windows installer bundles the following native binary so the tool's
OCR features work fully offline without a separate install:

Tesseract OCR           Apache-2.0      Fallback and Ensemble OCR engine
  Bundled with the installer under vendor/tesseract. The Tesseract engine
  itself is licensed under Apache-2.0. Its supporting runtime libraries
  are shipped as separate, unmodified shared libraries (DLLs) under their
  respective permissive licenses, including:
    - Leptonica                 Leptonica (BSD-2-Clause-style) license
    - ICU                       Unicode License
    - libpng / zlib             zlib/libpng license
    - libtiff, libjpeg, libwebp Independent JPEG / libtiff / WebP licenses
    - freetype, harfbuzz, cairo FreeType / MIT / LGPL terms
    - glib and supporting libs  LGPL (shipped unmodified as shared DLLs)
  The Apache-2.0 license text ships alongside the binary as
  vendor/tesseract/TESSERACT_LICENSE.txt.

Ghostscript             AGPL-3.0        NOT bundled / NOT distributed
  Ghostscript is required only for the optional Searchable PDF feature and
  is NOT distributed with this product. The application invokes a
  user-installed Ghostscript as a separate process (arm's-length use) and
  guides the user to download and install it themselves from the official
  site: https://ghostscript.com/releases/gsdnld.html
